<?xpacket begin="ï»¿" id="W5M0MpCehiHzreSzNTczkc9d"?>
<x:xmpmeta xmlns:x="adobe:ns:meta/">
  <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#">
    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">What Grows in the Silence</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Five years ago, Catraâ€™s world shattered with the sudden death of her wife, Adora. Now, she lives in a silent apartment filled with ghosts, her body a traitorous landscape of chronic pain she navigates with a cane and sheer stubbornness. Every morning is a battleâ€”against the ache in her bones, the memory of a laugh that will never sound again, and the crushing weight of a loneliness so deep it feels like a second skin.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A story about grief that doesnâ€™t end, but changes shape. About a body that can't be fixed, but can still be lived in. And about the quiet, stubborn courage it takes to open the curtains on a south-facing window and let the light back in.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
        <rdf:Seq>
          <rdf:li>weedcatra420</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Seq>
      </dc:creator>
